    <profile name="Terror Shriek" id="d28b-92e0-5932-52e2" hidden="false" typeId="3cda-8938-b7d6-58ab" typeName="Attack - Ranged">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="41f5-319f-6ccd-eaec">3&quot;</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="2088-497d-b499-8476"/>
        <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="b478-b971-cc61-444f">Piercing (1), Weaken</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="ANCIENT FURY" id="0a96-da07-b7c9-e7cc" hidden="false" typeId="39ba-3647-6510-7709" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power Cost" typeId="1bf9-e90f-6415-1697">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="4502-0f40-9d79-bc93">When this model makes a Run action, before the model is moved.</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b9cf-1e25-5292-ae34">The model may move up to three times its Speed in inches. In addition, if the move qualifies as a Charge action, the model has the Smash special rule in the following free Melee action.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="BLOOD SIPHON" id="aff3-973e-b437-7931" hidden="false" typeId="39ba-3647-6510-7709" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power Cost" typeId="1bf9-e90f-6415-1697">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="4502-0f40-9d79-bc93">When an enemy model Retaliates against this model.</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b9cf-1e25-5292-ae34">Resolve the Retaliation and if the vampire is still alive, even if Knocked-down, the Retaliating model suffers one automatic hit with Crushing Strength (2).</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="BRAAAINS" id="2f8b-dcfd-6eb2-69b7" hidden="false" typeId="39ba-3647-6510-7709" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power Cost" typeId="1bf9-e90f-6415-1697">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="4502-0f40-9d79-bc93">When this model activates.</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b9cf-1e25-5292-ae34">Place a new Zombie model anywhere within 3” of the Caster and more than 1” from any enemy models. Mark the new model as Activated. The newly raised Skeleton is now a member of the warband for the duration of the current game only.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="CHILLING STRIKE" id="effa-f50d-2648-5020" hidden="false" typeId="39ba-3647-6510-7709" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power Cost" typeId="1bf9-e90f-6415-1697">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="4502-0f40-9d79-bc93">When this model causes a wound with a Ranged attack with its Eldritch Warbow.</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b9cf-1e25-5292-ae34">The enemy model must make a Nerve test. If it fails it is moved 2&quot; directly away from the archer, or as far as possible (cannot come within 1&quot; of enemy models) and is marked as Fatigued.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="HE SLIMED ME" id="c244-6f23-ac0a-9723" hidden="false" typeId="39ba-3647-6510-7709" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power Cost" typeId="1bf9-e90f-6415-1697">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="4502-0f40-9d79-bc93">During this model&apos;s activation</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b9cf-1e25-5292-ae34">As a short action cast the Ectoplasmic Blast spell using an Ra value of 5+.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="SURGE" id="0b77-a495-caaf-4a08" hidden="false" typeId="39ba-3647-6510-7709" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power Cost" typeId="1bf9-e90f-6415-1697">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="4502-0f40-9d79-bc93">At any time.</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b9cf-1e25-5292-ae34">Nominate a model with the COMMAND type in the warband. All friendly Undead WARRIOR and GRUNT models within 9” of the nominated COMMAND model may immediately make a free Walk action, even if they have already activated this Round or are Fatigued.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="TORMENTOR FLAILS" id="fe17-3b04-6927-3a1f" hidden="false" typeId="39ba-3647-6510-7709" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power Cost" typeId="1bf9-e90f-6415-1697">X</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="4502-0f40-9d79-bc93">In the End Phase.</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b9cf-1e25-5292-ae34">Every enemy model within 3&quot; and LOS of this model is hit with a XD8 Melee attack from this model where X is the amount of Power used (with a minimum of 1). No retaliations are possible from these attacks.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
  </sharedProfiles>
  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Deathless Bond" id="e5ea-d5c6-d980-b72b" hidden="false">
      <description>Unlike a normal warband, an Undead warband is not Broken once it has less than half its models remaining. Instead, when the last COMMAND model in an Undead warband is killed, the warband is Broken, regardless of the number of models it has remaining.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Back from the Grave" id="9942-12a0-d14d-f7b0" hidden="false">
      <description>While the warband is not broken, all standing UNDEAD models within 6&quot; of a friendly COMMAND model, including Grunts, that are reduced to zero (or fewer) wounds, automatically get a Down But Not Out result. UNDEAD models attacked in Melee when already knocked-down, are removed as normal if reduced to zero (or fewer) wounds.
Once the warband is broken however, all UNDEAD models that are reduced to zero (or fewer) wounds, automatically get a Too Much Damage result.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Shallow Graves (short)" id="c2dd-c89e-2c7d-b490" hidden="false">
      <description>As a short action, this model may place a 25mm grave marker anywhere within 4&quot; (not into impassable terrain or onto a model). When a friendly Necromancer casts Raise Dead, the raised skeleton can be placed within 3&quot; of a grave marker rather than the Necromancer and then the grave marker is removed. Grave markers cannot be destroyed or moved but otherwise do not affect movement or LOS.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Chilling Presence" id="77cc-7ee8-a477-8446" hidden="false">
      <description>When an enemy model activates within  3&quot; of this model, it must make a Fallback! check, as though its warband were broken, before it makes any actions or uses abilities.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Uncanny Presence *" id="4e6f-0f4f-b4c5-b9a6" hidden="false">
      <description>Enemy models within 3&quot; of this model reduce their Ne by 1. If an enemy model is in range of multiple sources of this effect, only one is applied.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
